  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "playstyle",
      "title": {
        "en": "Playstyle"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": {
            "en": "Rin Dark Mist, and Retain Dark Mist"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "deck",
          "cards": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1018_uni3",
              "name": "Dark Mist Inner Art",
              "cost": 1,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 5,
                "name": "Dark Mist Inner Art V",
                "text": {
                  "en": "[Lead] If in a Dark Mist Stance state, increase Damage Amount of Attack Cards of this unit by 50%."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1018_uni3",
              "name": "Dark Mist Inner Art",
              "cost": 1,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 1,
                "name": "Dark Mist Inner Art I",
                "text": {
                  "en": "[Lead] Retain Dark Mist Stance for 1 turn. Dark Mist Stance: +80% Damage Amount to Attack Cards of this unit for 1 turn."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1018_uni3",
              "name": "Dark Mist Inner Art",
              "cost": 1,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 0,
                "name": "Dark Mist Inner Art",
                "text": {
                  "en": "[Lead] Retain Dark Mist Stance for 1 turn. Dark Mist Stance: +40% Damage Amount to Attack Cards of this unit for 1 turn."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Rin plays around her gimmick Dark Mist Stance\nDark Mist is gained from certain Rin Cards before Character Dupes\n1st Form, 3rd Form and Drawing Slash.\nRin Loses Dark Mist whenever a Different Ally Uses an Attack Card\nExtra Attacks do not make you loses Stance, but Activated Attack Cards yes\nWhen Rin is has Dark Mist Her Attack cards are Buffed\nRetain Dark Mist from Inner Art can skip 1 Ally Attack Card Use\nIdeally you just Never Lose Dark Mist instead"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Move vs Draw"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "deck",
          "cards": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1018_uni1",
              "name": "Dark Mist Secret Art: Destruction",
              "cost": 0,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 1,
                "name": "Dark Mist Secret Art: Destruction I",
                "text": {
                  "en": "100% Shield. Draw 2 card(s) of this unit. Gain Dark Mist Stance."
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Base Destruction version only \"Draws\" the Cards\nDrawing is different from Moving, and can only be taken from the Deck\nBut if your Cards are in your \"Discard\" \"Draw\" can force a \"Reshuffle\"\nOnce your Cards are in the Deck from Reshuffle, it Draws your Cards\n\"Move\" transfers the Card directly from zones into Hand\n\"Move\" can transfer from \"Deck\" \"Discard and \"Used\" Pile\n\"Move\" counts as Draw, Only if Moving the card from Deck, not Discard/Used"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": {
            "en": "2/4 Patch notes"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Really nice buff to Black Dance\nInner 1 is now okay, but Inner 5 is too consistent\nOverall nothing changed"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
